      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "4. Considering the submissions made and on going through the materials available on record as also the nature of accusations as those emanate therefrom and other surrounding circumstances; while being not inclined to reconsider the prayer for grant of bail to the Petitioner; this application stands disposed of with the observation that the Trial Court would do well to take all such effective steps, as provided in law, for early conclusion of the trial in accordance with law.\nIssue urgent certified copy as per rules.",
